<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Video Update as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Video Update as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said Video Update Inc was initiated as strong buy.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $0.26 per share for 1997, ending in April, and $0.42 for 1998, versus $0.14 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- set 12- to 18-month price target of $8 to $10. Shares gained 3/16 to 4-15/16.</p>
</text>
